# Live Google "Desktop app" OAuth credentials. Baked into the shipped binary
# (electron-builder ships it via the main/**/* glob) but never committed:
# a credential in a repo is far easier to harvest than one inside an installer.
# See main/googleCredentials.example.js for the shape.
